contentText:
Heated Rivalry , the wildly popular queer hockey drama starring Connor Storrie and Hudson Williams, has taken the world by storm since its premiere in November. The Justin Tierney-helmed Crave original (which airs on HBO Max in the states) has garnered hundreds of thousands of fans who have fallen in love with the show&#8217;s synchs and score, and they&#8217;ll soon be able to stream its official soundtrack, Billboard can exclusively confirm.

